{"type":"npc","name":"Electrum Juggernaut","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":170,"temp":0,"max":170,"details":""},"ac":{"value":34,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"electricity","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"physical","value":10,"exceptions":["adamantine"],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["luxan","talican","utopian","voltan"],"details":""},"level":{"value":11},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Electrum juggernauts are oversized, statue-like creatures made of a glittering alloy of gold and silver, with their outer shells formed into suits of glistening plate armor. These suits often mimic humanoid skin and muscles, while others embody the classic appearance of a gallant knight. No matter their style, their weapons are always the same, with one of their hands constructed around a longsword while the other features an inbuilt gauntlet. Although they appear as humanoids, their interiors are hollow, featuring a floating core that constantly emits electricity, which they can easily channel through their conductive frames.</p><p>Electrum juggernauts are known for their exceptional vanity, to the point where they are physically weakened when their glittering armor is soiled. They take immense pride in performing their assigned tasks to perfection. They typically guard massive treasure vaults, museums, dragon hoards, and other places that display precious objects.</p><h2>Neat and Tidy</h2><p>Adventurers planning to negotiate with an electrum juggernaut are well advised to polish and clean their equipment beforehand. Electrum juggernauts can't abide the sight of dirt on others any more than on themselves. However, for adventurers planning to fight an electrum juggernaut, filth can be an ally. While an electrum juggernaut has no qualms about stabbing a dirty enemy with their sword, they might think twice before grappling with one.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 175/390/720 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, slashing), armor (heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Athletics, Crafting, Intimidation, Religion, Society)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> body, bane, constitution, electricity, elongating, energy resistant (electricity, vitality), light, metal, sensory (darkvision), spells (Divine: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4]{Light}), spiked, strength, sturdy, throwing, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Jean","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":7},"dex":{"mod":1},"con":{"mod":6},"int":{"mod":3},"wis":{"mod":3},"cha":{"mod":5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":20,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"tremorsense","acuity":"imprecise","range":30}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":24,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":21,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":23},"crafting":{"base":20},"intimidation":{"base":23},"religion":{"base":22},"society":{"base":20}},"traits":{"value":["electricity","metal","monitor"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"_id":"LEZUVizmJszf7Pta","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/electrum-juggernaut.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Electrum Juggernaut","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":3,"height":3,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/electrum-juggernaut.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/electrum-juggernaut.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"name":"Divine Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":19,"dc":27},"tradition":{"value":"divine"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null}},"_id":"NjK9jxXtIpQYeYKT","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/light.webp","name":"Light","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create an orb of light that sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) in a color you choose. If you create the light in the same space as a willing creature, you can attach the light to the creature, causing it to float near that creature as it moves. You can Sustain the spell to move the light up to 60 feet; you can attach or detach it from a creature as part of this movement.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you Cast the Spell while you already have four <em>light</em> spells active, you must choose one of the existing spells to end.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{Spell Effect: Light}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The orb sheds light in a 60-foot radius (and dim light for the next 60 feet).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"light","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","light","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until your next daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NjK9jxXtIpQYeYKT"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"ggwOKpF7Fb4FHy3t"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Reactive Strike","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"reactive-strike","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.W7SbTykXrNwxDzJc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"ZjTJ5gzgYGBbaabV"},{"type":"action","name":"Conductive Shell","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The electrum juggernaut channels electricity through their metal frame. Until the beginning of their next turn, creatures that hit them with an unarmed attack or a melee attack or who otherwise touch them take @Damage[3d6[electricity]] damage. A @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} creature takes this damage once at the start of that creature's turn.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","electricity"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"VAmCLf7HKjP80vHK","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Vanity","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The electrum juggernaut takes pride in their armor's gleaming radiance and becomes metaphysically weakened if the armor is soiled. When a creature adjacent to the electrum juggernaut takes piercing or slashing damage or uses an Interact action to soil the electrum juggernaut's armor, or when a creature uses a spell or ability that would reasonably cause the juggernaut to become dirty at the GM's discretion, the juggernaut must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:28] save to avoid becoming stained. On a failure, the electrum juggernaut's AC is reduced to 31 and they lose both their resistance to physical damage and their Sparkling Armor ability. These effects last until the juggernaut spends 10 minutes cleaning their armor.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"vanity","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"ac","value":-3,"predicate":["vanity"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"swl9odlIKJ2dM2N8","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Grab","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"v